7. KEY CONVERSION PATTERNS
---------------------------
  SQL Server               -> PostgreSQL
  SCOPE_IDENTITY()         -> INSERT ... RETURNING productid
  GETDATE()                -> NOW()
  BEGIN TRANSACTION/COMMIT -> C# BeginTransactionAsync/CommitAsync
  DECLARE @Variable        -> C# variable declarations
  Products                 -> products (lowercase)
  ProductId                -> productid (lowercase)
  ProductHistory           -> producthistory (lowercase)
  ProductStats             -> productstats (lowercase)
  Microsoft.Data.SqlClient -> Npgsql
  SqlConnection            -> NpgsqlConnection
  SqlCommand               -> NpgsqlCommand
  SqlDataReader            -> NpgsqlDataReader
  Server=                  -> Host=
  Trusted_Connection=True  -> Username=postgres;Password=postgres

